All Main Story Chapter stages and [[Legend Stages]] and the maps in which they appear are rated on a '''scale of difficulty''' ranging from 1★ (easiest) to 12★ (hardest). Map buttons have ★ icons on them that light up based on the difficulty of each stage, which can be viewed in the sub-chapter's/event's information. Maps with stages of differing difficulties will have multiple ★s lit up (e.g., [[Vacation Awakes!]] is rated as both ★7 and ★8). Clearing [[Catclaw Championships]] will make turn all star colors from Yellow to a Pink color, depending on the highest rank you clear. For example, clearing Rank 9 will make all displays of all 9★ difficulty stages and below pink, but 10★ and above will stay yellow until you clear their respective rank.

==Star Difficulties==
*'''★1''': Rated for the first stages of many monthly and seasonal events as well as trivial stages that are meant to give players rewards without a fight, such as [[Sender Unknown]], [[CAT DAY]], [[Summer Break Cats (Gauntlet)|Summer Break Cats]], and the [[Stories of Legend]] stage [[Earthshaker]] only. Often tagged as "Easy". Chapter 1 of [[Empire of Cats]] up until [[Argentina (Empire of Cats)|Argentina]] will be tagged with this difficulty.
*'''★2''': Rated for most event stages that are tagged as "Normal" Stories of Legend stages from [[Return of Terror]] to [[Guardian of the Ranch]]. Ch.1 of Empire of Cats' Machu Picchu up until Ch.2 Greece will be tagged with this difficulty. Chapter 1 of [[Into the Future]] initially features the difficulty from [[Japan (Into the Future)|Japan]] up until [[Spain (Into the Future)|Spain]].
*'''★3''': Rated for most event stages that are tagged as "Hard" and Stories of Legend stages from [[Sleeping Lion]] to [[Sesamin Ruins]]. Ch.2 of Empire of Cats' Italy up until Ch.3 Greece and the first [[Monaco (Into the Future)|Monaco]] up until [[Thailand (Into the Future)|Thailand]] of Into the Future will be tagged with this difficulty.
*'''★4''': Rated for most event stages that are tagged as "Veteran" and Stories of Legend stages from [[Isoflavone Cave]] to [[Cowboy Mountain]]. Ch.3 Empire of Cats Italy up until the [[Moon (Empire of Cats)|Moon]] will have this difficulty, and in Into the Future Ch.1, [[Cambodia (Into the Future)|Cambodia]] up until [[Australia (Into the Future)|Australia]] will feature this difficulty.
*'''★5''': Rated for most event stages that are tagged as "Expert" and Stories of Legend stages from [[Rodeo Night]] to [[Volcanic Defender]]. Into the Future Ch.1's [[The Great Abyss (Into the Future)|The Great Abyss]] up until the [[Moon (Into the Future)|Moon]] of Chapter 1 will feature this difficulty.
*'''★6''': Rated for Stories of Legend stages from [[Flame Caldera]] to [[Pitfall Zone]]. Chapter 2 of Into the Future has this difficulty starting from Japan up until [[Brazil (Into the Future)|Brazil]]. In [[Cats of the Cosmos]], this difficulty is used in Chapter 1, from [[Earth (Cats of the Cosmos)|Earth]] to [[Betelgeuse (Cats of the Cosmos)|Betelgeuse]].
*'''★7''': Rated for most event stages that are tagged as "Insane", Stories of Legend stages from [[The Great Escaper]] to [[Imp's cold sweat]], and the [[:Category:Crazed Cat Stages|Crazed Cat Stages]]. This difficulty is also used in [[Floating Continent (Into the Future)|Floating Continent]] in Ch.2 up until Brazil in Ch.3 of Into the Future, and [[Deneb (Cats of the Cosmos)|Deneb]] up until [[Andromeda (Cats of the Cosmos)|Andromeda]] of Ch.1 of Cats of the Cosmos.
*'''★8''': Rated for [[Stories of Legend]] stages from [[Safe & not Sorry]] to [[Lord of the Abyss]]. Rated for event stages that are either tagged as "Insane" or "Deadly". The last two stages of [[Into the Future]] Ch.3, [[Black Hole (Cats of the Cosmos)|Black Hole]] up until [[Andromeda (Cats of the Cosmos)|Andromeda]] of Ch.2 of [[Cats of the Cosmos]] and the early stages of [[The Aku Realms]] ([[Korea (Aku Realm)|Korea]] - [[Germany (Aku Realm)|Germany]]) feature this difficulty.
*'''★9''': Rated for most event stages that are tagged as "Deadly", including [[Crazed Cats (origin)|Maniac Stages]], and [[Stories of Legend]] from [[Galapa-Goth]] onward. The entirety of the final chapter of [[Cats of the Cosmos]] and the middle of [[The Aku Realms]] ([[Italy (Aku Realm)|Italy]] + [[Denmark (Aku Realm)|Denmark]] - [[NASA (Aku Realm)|NASA]]) feature this difficulty.
*'''★10''': Rated for most event stages that are tagged as "Merciless", including Tier 2 [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stages]], and [[Uncanny Legends]] from [[A New Legend]] through [[Ancient Forest Labyrinth]]. The infamous [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 30|Floor 30]] and the later stages of [[The Aku Realms]] ([[Las Vegas (Aku Realm)|Las Vegas]] - [[Moon (Aku Realm)|Moon]]) feature this difficulty.
*'''★11''': Rated for [[Uncanny Legends]] from [[Castle of the Sentinels]] onward and [[Zero Legends]] from [[A Whole New World]] to [[Immeasurable Power]]. [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 40|Floor 40]] and the [[Mount Aku (Aku Realm)/Invasion|Mount Aku Invasion]] are also rated this.
*'''★12''': Rated for mostly event stages and is often referred to as "Brutal", including [[Zero Legends]] from [[Tower of the Time Lord]] onward, the last stages of [[:Category:Advent Stages#Great Advent Stages|Great Advent Stages]], [[Heavenly Tower/Floor 50|Heavenly Tower Floor 50]], [[Legend Quest]] (due to the randomness), [[Super Smash Families]], [[The Face of God/Invasion|The Face of God Invasion]] and some of the [[Gauntlet]]s.

==Difficulty Tags==
These difficulties were used in place of ★s before [[Version 10.7 Update|Version 10.7]]. Though obsolete, they still appear in parentheses next to the names of some stages such as [[No Plan A (Deadly)]] and [[Impact Site (Normal)]], and a 9th one was even added in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]].
*'''Easy''' (初級, ''Shokyū'', '''Beginner'''): Rated for the first and second levels of many events, they are the same difficulty as some [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1 or 2 levels.
*'''Normal''' (中級, ''Chūkyū'', '''Intermediate'''): A little bit harder, most of them require more than 100% [[Treasure]]s collected from [[Empire of Cats]] to beat. Rated for [[Value Ordeal (Normal)|Value Ordeal]], among others.
*'''Hard''' (上級, ''Jōkyū'', '''Advanced'''): Moderately hard most of the time. Rated for [[Love, Metal Hippoe (Hard)|Cat Ticket Chance!]], every last level of the weekday stages (not including the [[XP Stage|Weekend Stage]]) and for the first levels of the [[:Category:Catfruit Stages|Catfruit Stages]].
*'''Veteran (Hard+)''' (超上級, ''Chō Jōkyū'', '''Super-Advanced'''): Rated for the [[Daily Blitz Stages]] and some of the first [[:Category:Awakening Stages|Awakening Stages]]. These stages usually need [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] or a similar [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare]].
*'''Expert (Hard++)''' (激ムズ, ''Geki Muzu'', '''Intense''' or '''Fierce'''): Rated for the second levels of the [[:Category:Catfruit Stages|Catfruit Stages]], [[Super Metal Hippoe (Expert)|Siege of Hippoe!]], some of the first Awakening Stages, and the first four [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone Stages]]. Not recommended for new players because they can be pretty hard, especially without [[True Form]]s.
*'''Insane (Hard+++)''' (超激ムズ, ''Chō Geki Muzu'', '''Super-Intense''' or '''Super Fierce'''): Rated for the third levels of the [[:Category:Catfruit Stages|Catfruit Stages]], all [[:Category:Crazed Cat Stages|Crazed Cat Stages]], most of the second [[:Category:Awakening Stages|Awakening Stages]], [[Refined Palate (Insane)|XP Megablitz!]], and some of the [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone Stages]]. These are very difficult stages, beware when taking them on. They are balanced around the stage of progression that is from [[Into the Future]] Chapters 1 and 2 and around the sub-chapter [[Jail Break Tunnel]], where [[Ururun Wolf (Enemy)|Ururun Wolf]] is. After this point Insane stages can be treated as just the average farming stage and not much of a threat.
*'''Deadly''' (極ムズ, ''Goku Muzu'', '''Extreme'''): Rated for a few levels that have a unique boss that appears only in that level, such as [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stages]] and Maniac Stages, to make few examples, as well as [[Tempered in Flame (Deadly)|XP Colosseum]], [[The Wormhole Opens (Deadly)|The Wormhole Opens]] [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone Stage]] and all [[Stories of Legend]] stages from [[Stairway to Darkness]] onward. They are also not recommended for new players. They are usually [[No Continues]]. Most Deadly stages can only be played after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1. They are balanced around [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3 to [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapter 3, and the sub-chapter [[Silk Road]].
*'''Merciless''' (超極ムズ, ''Chō Goku Muzu'', '''Super-Extreme'''): Rated for [[Taste of Success (Merciless)|Merciless XP!]], [[Growing Strange]], [[Charybdis' Mouth (Merciless)|Charybdis' Mouth]], the later [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stages]] and some [[:Category:Collaboration Stages|collaboration-exclusive stages]]. [[Talents]] and [[Catseye]]s are often essential.
*'''Brutal''' (神ムズ, ''Kami Muzu'', '''God''', '''Godly''' or '''Godlike'''): The highest difficulty as of {{CurrentVer}}. Currently only rated for the final stages of [[:Category:Advent Stages#Great Advent Stages|Great Advent Stages]] as well as both stages of [[Super Smash Families]].
*'''Demon-grade''' (鬼級, ''Oni-kyū''), '''God-grade''' (神級, ''Kami-kyū'') and '''Dragon-grade''' (竜神級, ''Ryūjin-kyū''): A set of difficulties exclusive to the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]], they are roughly equivalent to Veteran, Expert and Insane, respectively.

==Notes==
The difficulty of stages may vary drastically depending on the player's strategy. [[Steel Visage (Deadly)|Steel Visage]] is a good example of this. It is very difficult without any [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hit Cats]] due to the nasty [[CyberFace]], but when using units like [[Catornado (Super Rare Cat)|Catornado]] and [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Waitress Cat]], the stage becomes much easier, as it can be easily defeated by [[Critical Hit|Critical Hits]].

==Trivia==
*The first stage of [[The Legend Begins]], [[Earthshaker]], is the only [[Stories of Legend]] stage to be rated as 1★, while [[Return of Terror]] through [[Guardian of the Ranch]] are the only 2★ Stories of Legend stages.
*[[Heavenly Tower]] is the only map to have all 12 ★ difficulties at once.
**Although [[Legend Quest]] also has this feature, it only has it in its selection screen, since the hardest levels that can be played only go up to 9 ★ difficulty.
*Under the original difficulty system, Legend Quest and Heavenly Tower were the only Legend Stages to have no difficulty rating.
*Hard+, Hard++ and Hard+++ were renamed to Veteran, Expert and Insane, respectively, with the release of [[No Plan A (Deadly)|No Plan A]], which would have been rated Hard++++ had the naming scheme not been changed.
*Due to the similarities between the japanese names for the Insane and Merciless difficulties (''Chō Geki Muzu'' and ''Chō Goku Muzu'' respectively), the stages in [[NEO Wanwan's Glory]] and the [[:Category:Malevolent Stages|Malevolent Stages]] all got mistranslated as Insane stages in BCEN despite being Merciless stages in BCJP.
*Prior to [[Version 10.7 Update|Version 10.7]], Stars served the same purpose as Crowns currently do.

